            195  *       B @POPY
            196  *
            197  *       EXIT TO NLIN0
            198  *
            199  * EXCEPTIONS AND CONDITIONS:
            200  *
            201  *       STACK UNDERFLOW
            202  *
            203  * ENTRY POINT:
            204  *
            205          DEF POPY
            206  *
00BA 8820   207  POPY   C    @GSC,@GSS         SOMETHING ON THE STACK ?
00BC 009C'
00BE 0090'
00C0 12E1   208         JLE  ERR12             N, ERROR
00C2 6820   209         S    @C4,@GSC          Y, BACKUP STACK POINTER
00C4 0000 
00C6 00BC'
00C8 0460   210         B    @NLIN0            CONTINUE
00CA 0000 
            211  *
            212         END
